<title>USA: Calif assemblywoman named to head insurance panel.</title>
<headline>Calif assemblywoman named to head insurance panel.</headline>
<dateline>SACRAMENTO, Calif. 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>California Assemblywoman Liz Figueroa was selected to serve as chair of the state Assembly Insurance Committee, her office said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The committee has oversight over legislation related to automobile, earthquake, worker's compensation and health insurance.</p>
<p>The assemblywoman, a Democrat from Fremont, previously served as the vice chair of the committee.</p>
</text>
